# New Game, then each stick in the first map (099.map) with twin-stick controls: for checks of the speeds
# the sticks give. Twin-stick is off under a pad script unless KF4_TWIN_STICK_SCRIPTED=1:
#   KF4_TWIN_STICK_SCRIPTED=1 kf4 --disc ... --headless --input tests/twin_stick.pad --frames 3000 --log FILE
# <vblank> <buttons or axes> [vblanks held, default 6]; axes 0..255, 128 centred, ly=0 is forward
100 CROSS 4     # the memory card notice ("no card")
300 START 4     # skip the logos
400 START 4     # Press Start
500 CROSS 4     # New Game (the cursor starts on it)
740 START 4     # skip the opening movie
700 CROSS 4
800 CROSS 4
900 CROSS 4
1000 CROSS 4
1100 CROSS 4
1200 CROSS 4
1300 CROSS 4
1400 CROSS 4
# the player has control from about vblank 1500; 60 vblanks of rest between, for the game's own slowing
1700 rx=255 60          # right stick full right: turn right at the top turn
1820 rx=192 60          # right stick half right: slower
1940 rx=0 60            # right stick full left: turn left
2060 lx=0 30            # left stick full left: step left, no turn
2150 ly=0 30            # left stick full forward: walk at the top speed
2240 ly=191 30          # left stick half back: slower
2330 lx=255 ly=0 30     # left stick forward and right: the top speed on the diagonal
2420 ly=0 CROSS 30      # forward with the action button: run
2510 ry=0 30            # right stick up: look up
